---
import SectionHeader from "~/components/ui/SectionHeader.astro";
---
<section class="container-page section">
  <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <SectionHeader eyebrow="The problem" title="Strategy doesn't execute itself." />
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 space-y-6 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] measure reveal">
      <p>
        Organisations struggle when strategy doesn't translate into what people
        need to know, do and change.
      </p>
      <p>
        A new strategy might require different leadership behaviours. A
        transformation might require new capabilities. A growth ambition might
        require an entirely different way of developing people. But somewhere
        between the strategy document and the organisational reality, things get
        complicated.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium">That's where I come in.</p>
      <p>
        I work with organisations to make sense of the challenge, identify the
        capabilities that matter, and design the programmes, experiences and
        interventions that move people from intention to action.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
